[Section: 32. CI/CD / simulation automation]

No CI workflow is observed.

A mature next step for this specific repository would have been lightweight simulation automation:

- install/open-source simulator;

- compile all `.sv` files;

- fail on missing `clock.sv`;

- run testbench to completion;

- parse nonzero/failing test result;

- archive waveform/log if desired.

This would be CI, not deployment. There is no meaningful CD target for the current simulation-only project.

